2026-07-29T13:57:44.6112752Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6113217Z i /tmp/RtmpbiLBGZ/duckdb
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6113536Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6113932Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6114255Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6115068Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6115790Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6116338Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
