2026-07-29T13:57:44.6463074Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-29T13:57:44.6909423Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-29T13:57:44.7086716Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
